 City Dubai, a global destination for business, innovation, and events.</p><p>Emaar South offers a complete lifestyle ecosystem with schools, retail, parks, healthcare facilities, and leisure spaces integrated throughout. With direct access to Emirates Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, residents enjoy smooth connectivity to Downtown Dubai, Dubai Marina, Jebel Ali, and major commercial districts, making it a prime choice for both living and Dubai South real estate investment.</p><ul><li>5 mins – Al Maktoum International Airport</li><li>30 mins – Dubai Marina</li><li>35 mins – Downtown Dubai &amp; Burj Khalifa</li><li>40 mins – Sheikh Zayed Road</li><li>45 mins – Dubai International Airport</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4763,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_1beeaf1cc0.pdf","hash":"brochure_1beeaf1cc0","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":3414,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4528,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Emaar_Vista_Ridge_bed_1_02b838f096.jpg","hash":"Emaar_Vista_Ridge_bed_1_02b838f096","name":"Emaar-Vista-Ridge-bed-1.jpg"},"title":"1 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4529,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Emaar_Vista_Ridge_bed_2_4630f2af8e.jpg","hash":"Emaar_Vista_Ridge_bed_2_4630f2af8e","name":"Emaar-Vista-Ridge-bed-2.jpg"},"title":"2 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4530,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazo