scover Vista Ridge by Emaar in Emaar South. Golf-view apartments and townhouses with resort-style amenities in Dubai South’s growth hub."},"more_info":[{"id":9311,"answer":"<p>Vista Ridge at Dubai South is a premium residential development by Emaar, located within the master-planned community of Emaar South. The project offers contemporary apartments and townhouses overlooking lush green landscapes and an 18-hole championship golf course. Designed for modern living, Vista Ridge combines nature, open space, and resort-style amenities in one of Dubai’s fastest-growing growth corridors.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Vista Ridge at Dubai South?"},{"id":9312,"answer":"<p>Vista Ridge at Emaar South is situated in Dubai South, close to Al Maktoum International Airport, Expo City Dubai, and major highways connecting to Downtown Dubai, Dubai Marina, and Jebel Ali. The location is known for its long-term growth potential, strong infrastructure planning, and connectivity, making it ideal for both living and investment.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is Vista Ridge at Emaar South located?"},{"id":9313,"answer":"<p>Vista Ridge Apartment options include 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as spacious 3-bedroom townhouses. Each residence features open-plan layouts, floor-to-ceiling windows, and balconies with green or golf views, offering a balance of elegance, space, and functionality.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of units are available at Vista Ridge Apartment?"},{"id":9314,"answer":"<p>Yes, Vista Ridge by Emaar Properties for Sale is considered a strong investment option due to its location in Dubai South, golf-front setting, Emaar brand value, and future infrastructure growth. The project appeals to both end users and tenants, making it attractive for rental yield and long-term capital appreciation.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Vista Ridge by Emaar Properties for Sale suitable for investment?"},{"id":9315,"answer":"<p>Vista Ridge by Emaar Amenities include a wide range of lifestyle and wellness facilities such as a resort-style swimming pool, indoor &amp; outdoor gym, padel court, yoga areas, BBQ zones, kids’ play areas, landscaped gardens, jogging trails, multipurpose rooms, and direct access to the golf course. The amenities are designed to support active living, family life, and relaxation.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at Vista Ridge by Emaar Amenities?"},{"id":9316,"answer":"<p>Yes, Vista Ridge is designed as a family-friendly community with safe walkways, open green spaces, kids’ play areas, and lifestyle amenities. Its location within Emaar South also ensures access to schools, healthcare facilities, retail outlets, and recreational spaces, making it ideal for long-term family living.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Vista Ridge a good option for families?"},{"id":9317,"answer":"<p>The expected handover for Vista Ridge is 2029 (estimated). As part of Emaar’s off-plan portfolio, the project is being developed with phased construction and a structured payment plan.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is the handover expected for Vista Ridge?"},{"id":9318,"answer":"<p>Vista Ridge stands out due to its direct golf course setting, low-density planning, premium design, and Emaar master developer quality. Unlike many developments in the area, it offers a true golf community lifestyle combined with resort-style amenities, positioning it among the most distinctive Dubai South off plan properties.</p>","question":"What makes Vista Ridge different from other Dubai South projects?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Emaar_Vista_Ridge_feature_93e0697f5e.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Emaar_Vista_Ridge_feature_93e0697f5e.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x252/Emaar_Vista_Ridge_feature_93e0697f5e.webp","